/src_assets/windows/drivers/vhf-gamepad/release-lock.json
# The consumer-signed virtual gamepad payload: the catalog and root-device setup
# tool the fetch job copies into the verified producer package, and the public
# certificate that travels beside them. Signed once on the build host and
# committed as artifacts; the signing key never leaves it. Without these
# negations the '*' pattern above silently drops the setup tool, and the build
# then fails with the payload "missing from the tree" while it sits right there
# on the developer's disk.
!packaging/windows/virtual_gamepad_driver/consumer-signed/*.exe
!packaging/windows/virtual_gamepad_driver/consumer-signed/*.cat
!packaging/windows/virtual_gamepad_driver/consumer-signed/*.cer

